to":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236677.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jules118","Id":236677,"Name":"jules118","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cdc41d5882792a955b601df198068d02","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks everyone - my guests should start receiving these today - can&#039;t wait to hear the responses!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1408975,"PostDate":1299079886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks everyone - my guests should start receiving these today - can't wait to hear the responses!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Steph & John........Atlantis.......June 18, 2011......happily married<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"steph@tmgatl.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283288642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231931.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skp1","Id":231931,"Name":"skp1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ff8bf3b5fcc9319ee010316e766f1bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; They look amazing! &amp;nbsp;How much do you think it cost you to make each invitation? &amp;nbsp;Where did you get the palm tree stamp for your wax seal?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1411694,"PostDate":1299467157,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> They look amazing! \u00a0How much do you think it cost you to make each invitation? \u00a0Where did you get the palm tree stamp for your wax seal?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christinakosar@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297913795,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236882.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ckntb","Id":236882,"Name":"ckntb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1067f11d36620c58e26b4e30ac7eb55","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It cost about $200 to make 50 invitations and literally half of that was the printing on the blue paper - so I can&#039;t stress enough - don&#039;t use dark paper.&amp;nbsp; i had too much vested at that point to change it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got the palm tree stamp and wax from Sam Flax which is a large art supply store - I think they have locations nationwide.&amp;nbsp; It was in their paper\/invitation department.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve also seen some on line with just Yahoo searches - don&#039;t know exact names but had contemplated ordering it first.&amp;nbsp; Michael&#039;s only had the standard heart or wedding themed ones.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1411869,"PostDate":1299512385,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It cost about $200 to make 50 invitations and literally half of that was the printing on the blue paper - so I can't stress enough - don't use dark paper.\u00a0 i had too much vested at that point to change it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got the palm tree stamp and wax from Sam Flax which is a large art supply store - I think they have locations nationwide.\u00a0 It was in their paper\/invitation department.\u00a0 I've also seen some on line with just Yahoo searches - don't know exact names but had contemplated ordering it first.\u00a0 Michael's only had the standard heart or wedding themed ones.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Steph & John........Atlantis.......June 18, 2011......happily married<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"steph@tmgatl.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283288642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231931.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skp1","Id":231931,"Name":"skp1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59943,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08150128779673c009b9a033d35c6d06","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These turned out fantastic!!!&amp;nbsp; GREAT JOB!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1411934,"PostDate":1299517977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These turned out fantastic!!!\u00a0 GREAT JOB!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Beaches Turks & Caicos - October 21, 2011<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"michelle0200@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274551114,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228450.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Michelle-2","Id":228450,"Name":"Michelle-2"