{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":53,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":5212,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1824747,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":270326,"Name":"deedeelala","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270326.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1389379964,"LastPoster":{"Id":279087,"Name":"Msmimi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":74,"Preview":{"Id":1824747,"PostDate":1389379964,"PostContent":"I know it is still super early but I just enjoy doing this kind of stuff and it's one more thing...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dianna.rubio@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370545567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270326.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deedeelala","Id":270326,"Name":"deedeelala","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":7,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8777b74682c37c36955d1672af79378b","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I know it is still super early but I just enjoy doing this kind of stuff and it&#039;s one more thing to cross off my checklist!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I would like to thank many of you for giving me so much inspiration and also for some of my text which I borrowed from all your great ideas.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;FYI I do not plan to mail these until about one or two months before our wedding Lol&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=core:attachments:25324]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=core:attachments:25323]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1824747,"PostDate":1389379964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>\n<div>I know it is still super early but I just enjoy doing this kind of stuff and it's one more thing to cross off my checklist!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I would like to thank many of you for giving me so much inspiration and also for some of my text which I borrowed from all your great ideas.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>FYI I do not plan to mail these until about one or two months before our wedding Lol<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1824747]' id='ipb-attach-url-25324-0-25331700-1444982672' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-270326-0-11415600-1389376189.jpg\" title=\"Outisde.JPG - Size: 138.25KB\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-270326-0-11415600-1389376189_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-25324-0-25331700-1444982672' style='width:150;height:117' class='attach' width=\"150\" height=\"117\" alt=\"Outisde.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1824747]' id='ipb-attach-url-25323-0-25993900-1444982672' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-270326-0-19060100-1389376180.jpg\" title=\"Inside.JPG - Size: 135.29KB\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-270326-0-19060100-1389376180_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-25323-0-25993900-1444982672' style='width:150;height:116' class='attach' width=\"150\" height=\"116\" alt=\"Inside.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dianna.rubio@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370545567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270326.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deedeelala","Id":270326,"Name":"deedeelala","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2387941ca316ca3c3c8b53818c12c028","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Looks great! You might as well get this stuff out of the way! I did the same, that way you don&#039;t have to worry about it when the time comes and you can go back and change things if need be! I don&#039;t know if you have already printed these out, but I was reading through and on the first page in the first sentence talking about soaking up the sun and sand on the beach, the beach part is written as one word \"thebeach\" you may be aware of it, but just in case I thought I would point out so you can fix it before you send it out! Hopefully I didn&#039;t offend you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also love that packing list where do you find that?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1824781,"PostDate":1389386196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Looks great! You might as well get this stuff out of the way! I did the same, that way you don't have to worry about it when the time comes and you can go back and change things if need be! I don't know if you have already printed these out, but I was reading through and on the first page in the first sentence talking about soaking up the sun and sand on the beach, the beach part is written as one word \"thebeach\" you may be aware of it, but just in case I thought I would point out so you can fix it before you send it out! Hopefully I didn't offend you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also love that packing list where do you find that?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happily Married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351784568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f5278e81d39c6d907122eff2838ebf2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!! I hadn&#039;t noticed I will change that!! Good catch!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The packing list I got from pinterest, they have a lot of different ones there!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1824783,"PostDate":1389386335,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks!!! I hadn't noticed I will change that!! Good catch!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The packing list I got from pinterest, they have a lot of different ones there!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dianna.rubio@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370545567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270326.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deedeelala","Id":270326,"Name":"deedeelala","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"845f4a2da966402d9a7b26320b483487","RawContent":"[quote name=\"deedeelala\" post=\"1824783\" timestamp=\"1389382735\"]\nThanks!!! I hadn&#039;t noticed I will change that!! Good catch!\n\nThe packing list I got from pinterest, they have a lot of different ones there!!![\/quote]Awesome! I am going to check it out! I might have to add it in to my pre travel brochure as well!\n\nI also made a pre-travel brochure. I&#039;d like to add a clip of it, but I am not sure how! @[member=\"deedeelala\"] can you tell me how you got yours on here?","Attachments":[],"Id":1824785,"PostDate":1389386792,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>deedeelala, on 10 January 2014 - 12:38 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thanks!!! I hadn't noticed I will change that!! Good catch!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The packing list I got from pinterest, they have a lot of different ones there!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Awesome! I am going to check it out! I might have to add it in to my pre travel brochure as well!<\/p><br \/><p>I also made a pre-travel brochure. I'd like to add a clip of it, but I am not sure how! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270326\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/270326-deedeelala\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deedeelala<\/span><\/a> can you tell me how you got yours on here?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happily Married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351784568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89e9324e24caaf60d0b682d3451b7d1a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just added it as an attachment, but then also clicked on the \"My Media\" button and selected the images from there. (You have to add it as an attachment first so that it shows up in your media folder)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that works!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1824790,"PostDate":1389387094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just added it as an attachment, but then also clicked on the \"My Media\" button and selected the images from there. (You have to add it as an attachment first so that it shows up in your media folder)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that works!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dianna.rubio@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370545567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270326.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deedeelala","Id":270326,"Name":"deedeelala","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"134.43.0.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c83b038b359d30efc00ab6696b4bd843","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;@&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270326-deedeelala\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;deedeelala&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;these look awesome -- SO SIMPLE which I love. Two questions: Did you design the background on Vista Print? Or a design site? Can you attach these in word? to the post? &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Thanks.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1824792,"PostDate":1389387168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span>@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270326-deedeelala\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>deedeelala<\/span><\/a>\u00a0these look awesome -- SO SIMPLE which I love. Two questions: Did you design the background on Vista Print? Or a design site? Can you attach these in word? to the post? <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Thanks.<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanessa.vlahakis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"134.43.0.1","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1384537231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"vanessav53","Id":275068,"Name":"vanessav53","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75944,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey"