"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8dd2e1886d8dcf022835079021066da","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Vanessa, I did it on Vistaprint super fast and easy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Csho, maybe try starting a new topic and I think you get the attachment option at the bottom. I can&#039;t see it anymore&amp;nbsp;when I&amp;nbsp;reply to this thread, so I think its only there when you start a new one. Sorry I am new here so I can&#039;t give you other ideas than that :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1824801,"PostDate":1389388209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Vanessa, I did it on Vistaprint super fast and easy!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>Csho, maybe try starting a new topic and I think you get the attachment option at the bottom. I can't see it anymore\u00a0when I\u00a0reply to this thread, so I think its only there when you start a new one. Sorry I am new here so I can't give you other ideas than that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dianna.rubio@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370545567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270326.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deedeelala","Id":270326,"Name":"deedeelala","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"Sh