","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yes, that was what I was thinking when I saw them too, an added flavor of Mexico to bring back into the AHR... Hmm, I&#039;m saving this idea!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Now - the place you purchased them, is that a local place in Philly, or is it onliine?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1342961,"PostDate":1290109353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes, that was what I was thinking when I saw them too, an added flavor of Mexico to bring back into the AHR... Hmm, I'm saving this idea!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Now - the place you purchased them, is that a local place in Philly, or is it onliine?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Married the love of my life in April!!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"erin82283@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1276044984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228983.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ellabaja1983","Id":228983,"Name":"Ellabaja1983","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58089,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d23d78851f80c72715dcc5cff639a84e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; \n Just an online store -- &lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Yes, that was what I was thinking when I saw them too, an added flavor of Mexico to bring back into the AHR... Hmm, I&#039;m saving this idea!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Now - the place you purchased them, is that a local place in Philly, or is it onliine?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/blockquote&gt; \n \n","Attachments":[],"Id":1342993,"PostDate":1290111176,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Just an online store -- <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Yes, that was what I was thinking when I saw them too, an added flavor of Mexico to bring back into the AHR... Hmm, I'm saving this idea!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Now - the place you purchased them, is that a local place in Philly, or is it onliine?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jszy10@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"204.13.205.130","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1277677752,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229614.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jszy10","Id":229614,"Name":"jszy10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58089,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6ece1dceb3842042039a8a799afd092","RawContent":"I created my tags today using Vistaprint. Thank you for the inspiration and ideas ladies. [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jszy10[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n that last line helped me find it!!  Thanks so much!!! \n \n \"Instead of tapping on your glass, \n here&#039;s a system with Mexican class.. \n Stand and shake with all your might, \n to see the groom kiss his bride tonight!\" \n \n Borrowed from a fellow BDW bride: \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/206963\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1414538,"PostDate":1299789263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> I created my tags today using Vistaprint. Thank you for the inspiration and ideas ladies.<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jszy10<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/spa